<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Rubik Academy | Çok Yakında!</title>

<style>
*{
    box-sizing:border-box;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
}

body{
    font-family: Inter, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background:#f8fbff;
    color:#162235;
}

a{
    text-decoration:none;
    color:inherit;
}

.page{
    min-height:100vh;
    padding: 40px 5% 60px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #dff3ff 0, transparent 40%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%, #edf6ff 0, transparent 30%),
    #f8fbff;
}

/* NAV / GERİ DÖN */
.nav-bar{
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.back-btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    padding: 11px 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #dceafd;
    color: #1684d1;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(22, 132, 209, 0.06);
    transition: all .25s ease;
}

.back-btn:hover{
    transform: translateX(-4px);
    border-color: #c0e0fc;
    background: #f4f9ff;
}

/* YAKINDA KART KUTUSU */
.coming-soon-card{
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 850px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 32px;
    border: 1px solid #e0eaf4;
    padding: 60px 40px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(39, 84, 125, 0.08);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.coming-soon-card::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    width:300px;
    height:300px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border: 45px solid rgba(240, 247, 255, 0.6);
    top:-150px;
    right:-100px;
    z-index: 1;
}

.content-wrap{
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
}

/* BADGE */
.badge{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    background: #edf7ff;
    border: 1px solid #cfe8ff;
    color: #1682d4;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.badge i{
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #20a4f3;
}

/* YAKINDA ICON (3D Kum Saati/Saat) */
.icon-wrap{
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
    margin: 0 auto 30px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 15px 20px rgba(22, 132, 209, 0.15));
    animation: floating 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes floating{
    0%,100%{ transform: translateY(0); }
    50%{ transform: translateY(-10px); }
}

.coming-soon-card h1{
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    color: #152238;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.coming-soon-card h1 span{
    color: #1682d4;
}

.coming-soon-card p{
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #708198;
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto 35px;
}

.action-btn{
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #1682d4;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(22, 130, 212, 0.3);
    transition: all .25s ease;
}

.action-btn:hover{
    background: #1272bc;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(22, 130, 212, 0.4);
}

@media(max-width:600px){
    .coming-soon-card{ padding: 40px 20px; }
    .icon-wrap{ width: 130px; height: 130px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="page">

<!-- GERİ DÖN NAVİGASYONU -->
<nav class="nav-bar">
    <a href="https://sites.google.com/view/rubikacademy/i%C3%A7erikler_1?authuser=0" class="back-btn">← Eğitimlere Geri Dön</a>
</nav>

<!-- İÇERİK KUTUSU -->
<div class="coming-soon-card">
    <div class="content-wrap">
        
        <div class="badge">
            <i></i>
            İÇERİK HAZIRLANIYOR
        </div>

        <!-- 3D ANİMASYONLU SAAT/SAYFA İKONU -->
        <div class="icon-wrap">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" width="100%" height="100%">
                <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="85" fill="#edf7ff" stroke="#cfe8ff" stroke-width="6"/>
                <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="65" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e0eaf4" stroke-width="4"/>
                <!-- Akrep / Yelkovan -->
                <path d="M100 100 L100 55" stroke="#1682d4" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M100 100 L135 100" stroke="#20a4f3" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="10" fill="#152238"/>
                <!-- Dekoratif Noktalar -->
                <circle cx="100" cy="42" r="4" fill="#708198"/>
                <circle cx="158" cy="100" r="4" fill="#708198"/>
                <circle cx="100" cy="158" r="4" fill="#708198"/>
                <circle cx="42" cy="100" r="4" fill="#708198"/>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <h1>Bu Eğitim <span>Çok Yakında!</span></h1>
        
        <p>
            Rubik Academy ekibi olarak bu bölümün rehber ve algoritma videolarını titizlikle hazırlıyoruz. Takipte kal, çok yakında yayınlanacak!
        </p>

        <a href="https://sites.google.com/view/rubikacademy/i%C3%A7erikler" class="action-btn">
            Diğer Eğitimlere Göz At →
        </a>

    </div>
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
